:` block; MCP `_embed_query` and ollama critic path now metered; regression test ties call-time tags to priced keys. Gate: 735 passed (+11).\n- **W5 â€” Scout memory + source-reputation** (`87e2192`, migration 0023): `roles/source_reputation.py` per-source yield tracking; explore/exploit seed prioritization respecting the 2-curator + 3-night-shadow promotion rule; source-quality surfaced in library/briefing/Helping Hand. Gate: 750 passed (+15).\n\n**Final gate state**\n- Ground-truth: `python -m pytest` = **750 passed** (684 baseline â†’ +66), no test weakening; security suite green throughout; `locate-plan.mjs` well-formedness gate exit 0.\n- OUT-OF-SCOPE honored: no parallel judgment fan-out, no WAL write-actor, no Foreman-durability checkpoints â€” serial judgment + serial evidence loops stand.\n- Commits **not pushed** â€” awaiting John's review.\n\n**Outstanding tripwires / residual risk (carried forward, not resolved)**\n- **W2:** backfill marks artifacts servable from name+short_description only, not payload â€” a malicious-payload/benign-description artifact is servable in enforce mode; do not treat enforce mode as production-trustworthy until a payload-depth scan supersedes it.\n- **W3:** badge is derived from pre-computed critics; true per-iteration LLM re-scoring is the promotion-gated upgrade, pending shadow-diff meeting the gate.\n- **W4:** opt-in alt providers (openai/xai/mistral) lack pricing keys â€” calls record visible $0 + one-time warning until rates added.\n- **W5:** yield history is **0 today** (existing sources predate `seed_id`); it accrues going forward with no fake backfill.\n- **W1 follow-up:** a 4-line CLAUDE.md Â§4 addition (surface `session_note`/`top_finds` verbatim) was **reverted** â€” editing the agent's own startup config wasn't authorized; needs John's OK.\n\nNote: I mapped \"foreman-handoff\" to `docs/foreman-handoff/` (titles match exactly). There are several sibling handoff dirs (`-awareness`, `-quality`, `-dashboard`, `-phase2`) â€” say the word if you meant one of those instead."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7582,"cache_read_input_tokens":35964,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7582},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f8cb6b74-30eb-4b3f-87cd-bec37580b2b0","uuid":"44e4e460-72b7-45aa-9df5-4d8c59396c89","request_id":"req_011Cc9WgM6gvVAhaQqrdHmv8"}
